\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Phase 2A test metrics on the leaky pipeline. Behavior-anchored algorithms (BC, AWAC, CQL, IQL) collapse to the equal-weight basin (Sharpe $\approx 0.94$, turnover $\le 0.005$) under friction; pure $Q$-maximizing algorithms with weak anchoring (TD3+BC, BCQ) escape the basin and produce implausibly high Sharpe by exploiting the in-observation reward signal. Equal-weight reference: Sharpe $0.953$. Mean $\pm $ std across 3 seeds.\relax }}{15}{table.caption.51}}
\newlabel{tab:leak-differential}{{4}{15}{Phase 2A test metrics on the leaky pipeline. Behavior-anchored algorithms (BC, AWAC, CQL, IQL) collapse to the equal-weight basin (Sharpe $\approx 0.94$, turnover $\le 0.005$) under friction; pure $Q$-maximizing algorithms with weak anchoring (TD3+BC, BCQ) escape the basin and produce implausibly high Sharpe by exploiting the in-observation reward signal. Equal-weight reference: Sharpe $0.953$. Mean $\pm $ std across 3 seeds.\relax }{table.caption.51}{}}
